DataBuilder and Data types are defined to transition from model to materialized model with backing data. Currently, only set data is provided. The api looks as follows:

```rust
use orx_math_model::*;

let m = Model::new();

let i = m.set();
let j = m.set();
let k = set_of(i);

let di = i.data(&(), |_| 3..7);
let dj = j.data(&(), |_| 1..3);
let dk = k.data(&(), |_, i| i..7);

let builder = m.data_builder().sets((di, dj, dk));
let data = builder.finish();
assert!(data.is_ok());
```

`builder.finish()` will return `Ok` only if all required data elements are provided.
